# Streamlit Application Assembly

Thin shell in **`app.py`**; sidebar/upload/configure live in split modules. Delegate ingest/build to **`app_services.py`** and rendering to **`pipeline.build_cross_section()`** → **`CrossSectionResult`**.

## Module split

| Module | Role |
|--------|------|
| `app.py` | `set_page_config`, session init, workflow routing, generate + staleness |
| `app_sidebar.py` | Sidebar: layout, style, consulting title block, **Section output** (borehole columns / track width), framing, Advanced water/GW, transect thresholds, import/AI |
| `app_upload.py` | Welcome card, workbook detect/parse |
| `app_build.py` | `collect_section_build_request()`, `generate_cross_section()` |
| `app_styles.py` | Shared CSS (`APP_CSS`) |
| `app_common.py` | Shared helpers (assistant, transect selection, quality refresh, legend) |
| `app_validate.py` | Validate step: Data Health, fix plan, lithology mapping, sheet roles |
| `app_configure.py` | Configure: transect sidebar, correlation health, manual overrides, section Q&A |
| `app_generate.py` | Generate, stale banner; **Prepare deliverables** (PNG/PDF/DOCX); **Drafter package** ZIP; folder save |
| `app_menubar.py` | Windows-style File/Edit/View/Help menus, Ctrl accelerators, `docs/help` dialogs |
| `app_state.py` | `DEFAULT_SESSION` + `SidebarState` (incl. track width / framing) + domain key groups / clear helpers |
| `app_services.py` | Cached ingest/recommend/build; Configure preflight warms geometry cache + post-cache QA (`_apply_section_geometry_qa`); no widgets; no *new* geometry algorithms |
| `ui_helpers.py` | Streamlit-free helpers: `active_transect_selection`, `svg_is_valid`, workflow stage |
| `ui_output_presets.py` | Named output presets → sidebar / `SectionBuildRequest` field mapping |
| `section_build_request.py` | Frozen `SectionBuildRequest` + `cache_key()` (UI staleness) + `geometry_cache_payload()` / `geometry_cache_key()` (engine DTO; also covered by `pipeline-orchestration.mdc`) |

## Integration Pattern

```python
parse_result, import_report = cached_ingest_workbook(uploaded_bytes, ...)
request = SectionBuildRequest(...)
subset = subset_parse_result(parse_result, active_hole_ids, lithology_index=...)
result = cached_build_section(subset.model_dump_json(), request.model_dump_json())
# → SVG-first; Prepare via cached_build_section_exports() (png/pdf wrappers share that draw)
# Geometry cache keys on request.geometry_cache_payload() — cosmetics (incl. export_framing, track_width_m, auto_fit_track_width) and QA flags do not bust geometry
# Post-cache: _apply_section_geometry_qa(fail_on_overlaps / warn_on_correlation_gaps)
```

- **UI staleness key:** `SectionBuildRequest.cache_key(hole_ids)` in `st.session_state.render_cache_key`
- **Geometry cache key:** `geometry_cache_payload()` JSON passed to `cached_compute_section_geometry` (not full request JSON; excludes cosmetics above and `fail_on_overlaps` / `warn_on_correlation_gaps`)
- **Transect selection cache:** `app_common._active_transect_selection()` memoizes `ui_helpers.active_transect_selection()` in session state
- **Session keys:** `DEFAULT_SESSION` in `app_state.py`; use `clear_section_output_state()` / domain clears
- **SVG display:** `st.markdown` + base64 `<img>` via `svg_display_meta()` — never `st.image()` on raw SVG
- **Menubar accelerators:** `app_menubar._inject_shortcut_bridge()` uses **`st.iframe(..., height=1)`** (must be `height > 0`). Do **not** use deprecated `st.components.v1.html`.
- **Lazy imports** for `ai_assistant` / `render_theme` inside helpers (avoid Streamlit hot-reload ImportErrors)
- **Help docs:** keep `docs/help/generate-exports.md` aligned with Prepare deliverables + Drafter package UX

## Workflow (four steps)

**Upload → Validate → Configure → Generate** (**Prepare deliverables** is a Generate export action, not a fifth step)

1. **Upload** — file uploader, profile, CRS, elevation, Parse; import report (optional sheets incl. Field Data OVA/EC → environmental readings, geology counts, `unit_order` / `unit_order_auto_assigned`)
2. **Validate** — Data Health, fix-path coach, lithology mapping, sheet roles, QA narrative; water/screens/environmental summaries when sheets (or Field Data–sourced readings) are present
3. **Configure** — transect (incl. NL pick), `cached_configure_preflight()` (correlation + overlap **and** warms `cached_compute_section_geometry`), environmental parameter multiselect → `SectionBuildRequest.environmental_parameters`, section Q&A, consulting report sheet fields
4. **Generate** — warnings gate, `cached_build_section()` (**SVG only**), overlap warnings; **Prepare deliverables** builds PNG+PDF via `cached_build_section_exports()` (one draw); optional DOCX; **Multi-transect ZIP** rebuilds each Configure batch line via `batch_export.build_multi_transect_exports`

## Layouts

- `section_sheet`, `consulting_section`, `chart` via `render_layout`
- Lithology fills use BH Log legend colours via `get_lithology_style()` (constants aliased as `USGS_LITHOLOGY_*`); legend in title block
- Track width / auto-fit under **Section output → Borehole columns** (`track_width_m`, `auto_fit_track_width` → profile; `resolve_track_half_width` in renderer)
- Optional workbook sheets: **Screens**, **Gradients**, **Environmental**, **Field Data** (OVA/EC → environmental readings; see `docs/workbook-format.md`)

## Boundaries

- Widgets only in `app*.py` (except services); `app_services.py` may call projection/stratigraphy for cache/preflight/build only
- Widget modules may use thin QA helpers (`suggest_offset_threshold_m`, etc.); do not reimplement geometry
- No new stratigraphy or projection algorithms in Streamlit modules
- Export framing / DOCX / ZIP packaging stay in `export_framing` / `docx_export` / `batch_export` (not engine geometry)
- Keep help docs under `docs/help/` aligned with Generate export UX (`generate-exports.md`)
